!csl4
!legend
: bind :: type := define = equal -> flow <- source => implies ~> cause |> pipeline <-> equivalent <: refine
W! required N! forbidden R! recommended M? permitted I> intent P> plan D> decided Q? question
status: ok part rep X unk hyp dep law (absent = open)
#P problem #D decompose #T trace #S synthesize #C conclude ^id label-or-reference
{t time} {x source} {s sign-off} {c constraint} `raw` !def definitions !ans answer !. end
!.
!def
hub: apocky.(com project-home) + identity-root
threshold: dedicated APXv2<->world interface @ /chat
commons: shared social habitat - chatbot shell
presence: APXv2-authored visible state + mutual-consent receipt
world-window: consent-bounded input channel for file + image + audio + video + URL + screen + camera
artifact: participant-shared media object + provenance + audience + retention + withdrawal
room: participant set + privacy boundary + conversation + artifact context
quiet-mode: co-presence - forced exchange
design-feature: Claude Code Design capability for visual exploration + high-fidelity frames + prototype
truth-state: live capability + designed capability + future capability kept distinct
